('the-glad-cafe-glasgow', 'The Glad Café', 'cafe', 'published', 'Scotland', 'Glasgow', 'Glasgow', 'G42 8PB', 55.8340, -4.2650, 'A community café and live music venue in Shawlands with dogs welcome during daytime café hours.', 'The Glad Café is a much-loved community space that doubles as a café by day. Dogs are welcome during daytime hours and the atmosphere is always relaxed. Good coffee, homemade cakes and a genuinely warm vibe.', 'A lovely community café where dogs are part of the furniture. Calm daytime atmosphere suits tiny dogs.', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'low', 'relaxed', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'Weekday mornings', 'Coffee, homemade cakes, soups, toasties', '£', 'warm_little_welcome', 76, ARRAY['Warm Little Welcome', 'Little paws welcome inside', 'Quiet corner available'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'personal_visit', '2026-06-18'),

