('pettigrew-tea-rooms-cardiff', 'Pettigrew Tea Rooms', 'tearoom', 'published', 'Wales', 'Cardiff', 'Cardiff', 'CF10 3DX', 51.4870, -3.1780, 'An elegant tearoom in Bute Park with outdoor seating in the park grounds and a warm dog welcome.', 'Set in the old Gatekeeper''s cottage at the entrance to Bute Park, Pettigrew is one of Cardiff''s best-kept secrets. Dogs welcome at all outdoor tables with the park right on the doorstep for pre or post-tea walks.', 'A beautiful park tearoom where dogs are welcome outdoors. Perfect after a gentle stroll through Bute Park.', 'no', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'low', 'relaxed', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'Weekend morning before it gets busy', 'Afternoon tea, cakes, sandwiches, loose-leaf tea', '££', 'warm_little_welcome', 72, ARRAY['Warm Little Welcome', 'Perfect after walkies', 'Rainy day rescue'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'personal_visit', '2026-06-25'),

