('the-broad-chare-newcastle', 'The Broad Chare', 'pub', 'published', 'North East', 'Tyne and Wear', 'Newcastle', 'NE1 3DQ', 54.9690, -1.5990, 'A proper quayside pub near the Tyne Bridge with dogs welcome in the ground floor bar and excellent food.', 'Owned by chef Terry Laybourne, The Broad Chare combines serious food with proper pub atmosphere. Dogs welcome in the ground floor bar which has wooden floors and a relaxed feel. The upstairs restaurant is dog-free.', 'A quality quayside pub where tiny dogs are welcome in the characterful downstairs bar.', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'low', 'moderate', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'Weekday lunchtimes', 'Gastropub classics, local ales, wines', '££', 'warm_little_welcome', 72, ARRAY['Warm Little Welcome', 'Little paws welcome inside', 'Best for a calm lunch'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'personal_visit', '2026-06-30'),

