('the-green-bird-cafe-bath', 'The Green Bird Café', 'cafe', 'published', 'South West', 'Somerset', 'Bath', 'BA1 2QZ', 51.3820, -2.3590, 'An independent café near the Royal Crescent with dogs welcome inside and homemade everything.', 'A lovely independent café near one of Bath''s best walking spots. Dogs welcome inside, generous portions, homemade cakes and a genuinely warm atmosphere. The perfect post-Victoria Park stroll reward.', 'A homely café where tiny dogs are genuinely welcomed. Great after a Royal Crescent or Victoria Park walk.', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'low', 'relaxed', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'Mid-morning on weekdays', 'Homemade cakes, brunch, lunch, specialty coffee', '£', 'tiny_dog_favourite', 86, ARRAY['Tiny Dog Favourite', 'Little paws welcome inside', 'Treats behind the bar', 'Quiet corner available'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'personal_visit', '2026-07-01'),

