('the-house-of-trembling-madness-york', 'House of Trembling Madness', 'pub', 'published', 'Yorkshire', 'North Yorkshire', 'York', 'YO1 8BJ', 53.9610, -1.0810, 'A medieval drinking hall above a bottle shop on Stonegate with dogs welcome and an extraordinary interior.', 'A genuinely unique York experience — a medieval first-floor hall with antlers, taxidermy and an enormous beer list. Dogs welcome and the staff love them. The vibe is eccentric, cosy and relaxed.', 'An eccentric medieval pub where dogs are part of the charm. The atmosphere is unique and welcoming.', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'no', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'yes', 'low', 'moderate', 'yes', 'yes', 'no', 'no', 'no', 'yes', 'yes', 'Early evening for a relaxed pint', 'Craft beers, real ales, cheese boards', '££', 'tiny_dog_favourite', 84, ARRAY['Tiny Dog Favourite', 'Little paws welcome inside', 'Treats behind the bar'], ARRAY[]::text[], 'personal_visit', '2026-06-14'),

